      "description": "With over 30 million users globally, Americans can now trade on the World's Largest Prediction Market™\n \nPolymarket is a federally regulated exchange that lets you trade real-world events against other market participants, so prices move with the wisdom of crowds. Live odds show you where the smart money really sits, a sharp tool whether you're researching sports picks, weighing insights, or forecasting elections and the news.  \n\nTRADE ON ANYTHING\n- Trade on sports, geopolitics, elections, news, tech, culture, crypto, & more\n- Put your money where your mouth is, and earn a return for your knowledge\n\nLIVETRADE™ IN GAME\nInstantaneously enter and exit positions in real time as the game or event unfolds \n\nHOW DOES IT WORK?\n- Prices = probability\n- If something has a 67% chance of happening, you can buy shares for $0.67 each which you can sell if the price goes up — or earn $1 each if you're right\n- If you think the odds are wrong, you can make money by buying shares in the polymarket \n\nPRICES ARE FORECASTS\nPeople check Polymarket odds like they check the weather. The prices are live forecasts made by people with something at stake, which is why newsrooms and analysts cite them.\n\nLEGAL & REGULATED\n- Polymarket is fully legal & CFTC regulated in the United States — in all 50 states*\n- Bank-grade security & encryption\n- 24/7 live customer support\n \nWHAT YOU CAN TRADE\nSPORTS MARKETS: NFL, NBA, MLB, NHL, MLS, UFC, NPB, KBO, Liga MX, WNBA, CFB, EPL, UCL, La Liga, Serie A, Bundesliga Champion, college basketball, boxing, motorsports, cricket, cycling, soccer, college basketball, tennis, table tennis, golf, MMA, esports, chess, and more. Trade game winners, totals, and championship futures like the Super Bowl and NBA Finals.\nELECTIONS & POLITICS: Presidential election markets, party control, political forecasting, midterms, and more. \nFINANCIAL & ECONOMIC MARKETS: Fed interest rates, GDP, and more.\nWEATHER MARKETS: Daily temperature markets in major cities.\nCULTURE MARKETS: Oscars, Emmys, #1 hits, Big Brother, and more.  \nMORE MARKETS: News, tech, crypto, bitcoin, culture, finance, and the economy, with new markets added all the time.\n\nPREDICTION MARKETS VS STOCKS\nEvent contracts are directly tied to the outcome of specific events. You trade the outcome itself, not a company's stock price. In stock trading you can be right and still lose money to market sentiment. Prediction markets remove that layer: if you're right about the outcome of the event, you win.\n \nWHO POLYMARKET IS FOR\n- Sports fans who want to trade real game outcomes\n- Election watchers, news junkies, and forecasters who put money behind their views\n- Anyone who follows sports picks, market forecasts, or real-world probabilities\n \nMARKET INTEGRITY AND RISK\nPolymarket bans insider trading and market manipulation. Trading on confidential information in violation of a duty of trust or confidence you owe to a person or an entity, or on markets whose outcome you have influence sufficient to affect, is strictly prohibited. See integrity.polymarket.us for more information.\n\nGET STARTED\nFree to download and free to open an account. Trade in US dollars, deposit in minutes by debit card or bank transfer, and start with as little or as much as you want.\n \nYou see the future. Now trade it.\n\n* Trading currently unavailable in NV\n18+ only. Restrictions and eligibility requirements apply. Not available in all jurisdictions. Trading involves high risk and may result in loss of your entire investment. See polymarket.us/tos for more information. Polymarket App serves as an independent software provider and affiliate of Polymarket US and Polymarket Clearing, the CFTC-regulated derivatives exchange and clearing organization.",
